5.1.evidence:
a. establishing and facilitating the operation of integrated service institutions for victims by involving community elements;
Every victim has the right to obtain protection, information, integrated services, continuous handling up to the rehabilitation stage, and confidential handling, whether by individuals, groups, or institutions, both from the Regency Government and non-government.
Assistance is carried out by persons or institutions that have expertise to conduct counseling, therapy and advocacy for the strengthening and recovery of victims of violence and have cooperated with PPT.
